# Prideful Parent: vigilance (CR 702.20b). On turn 3 Bot1 attacks Bot2 with the Parent and with the Cat token its enters trigger
# made on turn 1: the token taps to attack, the Parent, which has vigilance, stays untapped (a positive control that attacking
# does tap a creature without it). Both connect: 2 + 1 combat damage takes Bot2 from 20 to 17.

[Bot1 Deck]
Prideful Parent
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Prideful Parent.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Prideful Parent > Bot2; Cat Token > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Prideful Parent.Tapped = false
? Bot1.Battlefield.Cat Token.Tapped = true
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 17
Bot1.Battlefield.Prideful Parent.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Cat Token.Tapped = true
